{"chapter-slug":"rw4-31","paragraph":371,"wording":"[General of the Line]","event":"named","holder-quote":"Zel glanced at Ryoka in surprise and then he grimaced.","id":"d83afaf8-46ac-5190-a526-73365fba0f43"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw4-30","paragraph":213,"wording":"[General of the Line]","event":"named","holder-slug":"zel-shivertail","holder-quote":"He was a [General of the Line], a protector of his people. And they were dying while he took cover. Zel clenched his fist.","id":"69b73397-e88f-5c3f-b623-749ee33de55a"}
